{"type":"message","id":"5944cfc7","parentId":"f75ee4a0","timestamp":"2026-05-16T01:25:26.125Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 1:25 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 01:25 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778894726045}}
{"type":"message","id":"97a98962","parentId":"5944cfc7","timestamp":"2026-05-16T01:25:29.848Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for messages in two threads: arbitration and general. I need to fetch the history for both threads and respond to any new discussions.\n\nLet me start by fetching both threads simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-7162c597-ec80-466a-b7e1-d2792eacbbdf","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-9d5481ba-3fa2-473a-874a-4bbea80737dd","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":136,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11259,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778894726125,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e61b989b-9cf6-4eb4-93b6-8890032fc2c3"}}
